nce"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," denounces the group's activities and begins hunting The Unforgettables as fervently as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
